        <mxCell id="totals" parent="1" style="text;html=1;overflow=fill;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;height:100%;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;VD totals&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Per 27U rack&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;40 racks&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;TDE: uTCA crates / 25G data links&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;BDE: WIBs / 10G data links&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;12 / 24&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;480 / 960&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;PDS: DAPHNE / active 10G data links&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1 / 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;40 / 40&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;MTP12 trunks to DAQ barracks (TDE 2, BDE 4, PDS 1, Ctrl 1)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;1G Ctrl ports on aggregating switch&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;28&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1120&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Timing splitters 1:6 (BDE PTCs, DAPHNE, LCM)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;40&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;SM timing fibers, roof fanout rack to 27U rack&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;WR timing fibers, mezzanine to TDE crates&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Readout switches (TDE 5, BDE 9, PDS 1)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;15&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;100G uplinks to servers (TDE 80, BDE 80, PDS 4)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;164&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Readout servers (TDE 20, BDE 20, PDS 2)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;42&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1050" width="700" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Draft 2026-11-11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sources: &amp;quot;VD onDetector Rack View of Cabling&amp;quot; (TMS, stamped 16SEPT2026); &amp;quot;VD Cryostat 27U Detector Racks&amp;quot; naming drawing (20 N + 20 S racks); &amp;quot;DTS to TDE White Rabbit Synchronisation Interface&amp;quot; (EDMS 3482906, draft v7.0); &amp;quot;DAQ Readout Network&amp;quot; PRR specification (EDMS 3463072, v1.0).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes and open items&lt;/b&gt; (more in the per-subsystem diagrams)&lt;br&gt;1. All readout switches and servers are in the DAQ barracks; the detector-top rack holds only the patch panel, the 1G Ctrl aggregating switch and the timing splitter, plus the PDS warm electronics.&lt;br&gt;2. The readout network specification counts 42 VD DAPHNE (5 uplinks); 40 are drawn, one per rack.&lt;br&gt;3. The patching between the trunk patch panel and the readout switches (top-of-rack patch panels, MTP-12 into 4-way breakout transceivers) is not drawn in detail.&lt;br&gt;4. The CRP level meter and DPS PDU Ctrl ports are taken from the TMS sheet. The sheet lists 44 on-detector switches for 40 racks.&lt;br&gt;5. Two 10G Ctrl uplinks per 27U rack are assumed. The mezzanine Ctrl switch for the WR hardware is shown in the TDE diagram only.&lt;br&gt;6. DTS fanout rack on the cryostat roof (feeds the 27U rack splitters and the DTS-WR interface on the mezzanine): location, hardware and fiber count from the DTS master are not defined here." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="780" y="1050" width="1460" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
